,"end":261,"description":"Granulin-3"},{"type":"Glycosylation","start":236,"end":236,"description":"N-linked (GlcNAc...) asparagine"},{"type":"Glycosylation","start":265,"end":265,"description":"N-linked (GlcNAc...) asparagine"},{"type":"Peptide","start":281,"end":336,"description":"Granulin-4"},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":284,"end":296,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":290,"end":306,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":297,"end":314,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":307,"end":321,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":315,"end":328,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":322,"end":335,"description":""},{"type":"Peptide","start":364,"end":417,"description":"Granulin-5"},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":366,"end":378,"description":""},{"type":"Glycosylation","start":368,"end":368,"description":"N-linked (GlcNAc...) asparagine"},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":372,"end":388,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":397,"end":410,"description":""},{"type":"Disulfide bond","start":404,"end":416,"description":""},{"type":"Peptide","start":442,"end":496,"description":"Granulin-6"},{"type":"Peptide","start":518,"end":573,"description":"Granulin-7"},{"type":"Glycosylation","start":530,"end":530,"description":"N-linked (GlcNAc...) asparagine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Progranulin is secreted as a homodimer (PubMed:23364791). Interacts with SLPI; interaction protects progranulin from proteolysis (PubMed:12526812). Interacts (via region corresponding to granulin-7 peptide) with CTSD; stabilizes CTSD and increases its proteolytic activity (PubMed:28453791). Interacts (via region corresponding to granulin-7 peptide) with SORT1; this interaction mediates endocytosis and lysosome delivery of progranulin; interaction occurs at the neuronal cell surface in a stressed nervous system (PubMed:21092856). Interacts with PSAP; facilitates lysosomal delivery of progranulin from the extracellular space and the biosynthetic pathway (PubMed:26370502). Forms a complex with PSAP and M6PR; PSAP bridges the binding between progranulin and M6PR (PubMed:26370502). Forms a complex with PSAP and SORT1; progranulin bridges the interaction between PSAP and SORT1; facilitates lysosomal targeting of PSAP via SORT1; interaction enhances PSAP uptake in primary cortical neurons (PubMed:28541286). Interacts (via regions corresponding to granulin-2 and granulin-7 peptides) with GBA1; this interaction prevents aggregation of GBA1-SCARB2 complex via interaction with HSPA1A upon stress (PubMed:27789271). Interacts (via region corresponding to granulin-7 peptide) with HSPA1A; mediates recruitment of HSPA1A to GBA1 and prevents GBA1 aggregation in response to stress (PubMed:27789271)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P28799-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":438,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,376],[377,532,62]],"edits":[{"start":377,"end":531,"original":"TCCQLTSGEWGCCPIPEAVCCSDHQHCCPQGYTCVAEGQC","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":155,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":121,"foldedMissing":121,"features":[[17,41,0],[18,1,0],[20,1,0],[21,2,0],[22,2,0],[23,55,0],[24,14,0],[25,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P28799-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P28799-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":78.3,"plddt":[[0,3],[50,2],[0,3],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,4],[70,16],[0,1],[50,2],[70,6],[50,2],[0,1],[50,9],[70,1],[50,10],[70,10],[50,4],[70,15],[50,1],[70,18],[50,3],[0,5],[50,2],[70,4],[50,2],[70,8],[90,5],[70,4],[90,4],[70,4],[90,12],[70,2],[90,4],[70,4],[90,3],[70,9],[90,2],[70,5],[50,2],[0,6],[50,2],[70,13],[90,6],[70,4],[90,5],[70,2],[90,14],[70,1],[90,6],[70,2],[90,4],[70,6],[90,5],[70,4],[50,3],[70,14],[90,5],[70,4],[90,5],[70,3],[90,13],[70,1],[90,4],[70,4],[90,3],[70,9],[90,2],[70,5],[50,2],[0,7],[50,1],[70,15],[90,2],[70,6],[90,4],[